mcp_audit_report.json
/tests/mcp_audit_report.json
/tests/mcp/mcp_audit_report.json

# Local agent-context note (never shipped)
CONTEXT.md

# ============================================================================
# META-AWARE-2 GENERATED RUN ARTIFACTS (GROMA #7, 2026-09-27)
# ============================================================================
# The meta-aware-2 subtree mixes tracked sources (.md/.py/.toml doc-stub dirs,
# code, config) with generated run artifacts. Run logs are already covered by
# the global `*.log` rule and the meta-aware-2/logs/ directory by the global
# `logs/` rule above; the patterns here pin the remaining generated classes
# (top-level verification report, results pickles+json, figure rasters) so
# they cannot silently return as tracked files.
docs/cognitive_phenomena/meta-aware-2/verification_report.json
docs/cognitive_phenomena/meta-aware-2/results/*.pkl
docs/cognitive_phenomena/meta-aware-2/results/*.json
docs/cognitive_phenomena/meta-aware-2/figures/*.png

# ============================================================================
# META-AWARENESS GENERATED PAPER-FIGURE RASTERS (GROMA sibling hygiene, 2026-09-28)
# ============================================================================
# The meta-awareness subtree mixes tracked sources (.md/.py doc-stub dirs, code,
# config) with generated figure rasters: in-repo reproductions of Sandved-Smith
# et al. (2021) figures computed by run_paper_simulations.py / sandved_smith_2021.py
# / visualizations.py (fixed seeds), not rasters extracted from the published
# paper. The pattern here pins the figure-raster class under the figures_fig*
# doc-stub dirs so they cannot silently return as tracked files.
docs/cognitive_phenomena/meta-awareness/figures_fig*/*.png
